english value:
Your account is signed in from another device;
please switch accounts or close the game on your
other devices and try again.

${TITLE} Performed by ${PERFORMER}
Composed by ${COMPOSER}, Arranged by ${ARRANGER}, Published by ${PUBLISHER},
Courtesy of ${SOURCE}

These come in packs of 3;
Useful for base defense or
stopping speedy enemies.

translated value:
Näitä tulee 3 kappaleen pakkauksissa;
Hyödyllinen peruspuolustukseen tai
pysäyttää nopeita vihollisia.

